        <headline>Gale Warning issued September 24 at 4:15AM AKDT until September 24 at 5:00PM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK</headline>
        <description>Offshore Waters Forecast for the Bering Sea

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent an average of the highest
one-third of the combined wind wave and swell height.

.TODAY...S wind 25 to 40 kt diminishing to 10 to 25 kt in the
afternoon. Seas 13 to 20 ft. Rain.
.TONIGHT...N wind 10 to 25 kt. Seas 14 to 19 ft.
.FRI...NW wind 10 to 25 kt. Seas 9 to 17 ft.
.FRI NIGHT...NW wind 10 to 20 kt. Seas 8 to 13 ft.
.SAT THROUGH MON...W wind 10 to 20 kt. Seas 5 to 9 ft.
</description>
